{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-firsttime|T10", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You pick the phone back up and explain your choice to Lieutenant Busset.", "passage": "phonereveal-firsttime", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-firsttime|T11", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "Why. How. The evidence. Your sources. She listens without saying a word.", "passage": "phonereveal-firsttime", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-good|T24", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You stop talking and catch your breath.", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-good", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-good|T26", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ok. »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-good", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-good|T28", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’ll buy it… Seems like a solid choice. I can fish around a bit to vet your information.»", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-good", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-good|T29", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She pauses. You can almost hear her nodding.", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-good", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T34", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "When you finish talking, she remains silent for just a second too long. You sense she’s not convinced.", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T35", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Listen… are you sure of what you’re saying? »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T36", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Because between what you told me this morning and what you’re saying now… something’s not right. »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T37", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« You’re sure this is the suspect you want to pursue? »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T38", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Yes. »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "emote": ":positive:", "link": "phonereveal-easy-bad-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "« Sí. »", "status": "TRANSLATED", "locked": false, "origin": "tm"}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad|T39", "type": "CHOICE", "en": "« Wait a minute. »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad", "emote": ":puzzled:", "link": "phonereveal-secondchance", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-secondchance|T44", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You put the phone down. Maybe she’s right? You’re not so sure anymore…", "passage": "phonereveal-secondchance", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad-outro|T51", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ok then. I’ll put my guys on it and find a way to make all this more presentable. »", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad-outro", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-easy-bad-outro|T52", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You take a deep breath. She does the same.", "passage": "phonereveal-easy-bad-outro", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-lastchance|T58", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You pick the phone back up and explain your choice to the lieutenant. Very quickly… too quickly… She cuts you off.", "passage": "phonereveal-lastchance", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-lastchance|T59", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Ok, ok. We’ll follow this lead. I’m going to see what I can do with all this. »", "passage": "phonereveal-lastchance", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-lastchance|T60", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She heaves a huge sigh.", "passage": "phonereveal-lastchance", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-lastchance|T61", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« Shit, I hope for your sake it’s good work. »", "passage": "phonereveal-lastchance", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-lastchance|T62", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "And before you can get a word in edgewise…", "passage": "phonereveal-lastchance", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T67", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« I’ll call you tonight. Try to get some sleep.»", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T68", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She pauses. No way she’s going to hang up on such a… positive note. No, she’s probably going to…", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T69", "type": "DIALOGUE", "en": "« …it might be your last night of freedom. »", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "speaker": "BUSSET", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T70", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "She snickers and hangs up.", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T72", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You put the phone down. You might as well be standing in the ice-cold emptiness of outer space.", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
{"id": "927_phone_reveal|phonereveal-end|T73", "type": "NARRATION", "en": "You decide to go to bed. To sleep. Best way to kill time.", "passage": "phonereveal-end", "source": "textasset", "es": "", "status": "TODO", "locked": false}
